  "description": "Given a chance to redo her sad, short life, neglected noble daughter Panora Celsius swears to live only for revenge against all who wronged her. But living her second life to the violent fullest comes with unintended consequences, such as unlikely friends and dangerous new romantic allies! As she watches her enemies weep, her conscience grows, and the future she knew begins to shift like sand beneath her feet. Will she be able to outsmart her enemies, old and new, until the end?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
